description	"The Saboteur

A master of speed, stealth, and striking from the shadows.

^2Weaponry:
- Sonic Pistol (1)
-- Stuns on hit
-- Mag Reload
- Combat Knife
-- ^5Cyan ^7Style Only
- 4 Flashbang Grenades [Alt Fire Only]
- 3 Trip Mines

^6Equipment:
- Passive Radar Scanner (1)
- Cloaking Device (2)
- Electrobinoculars

^8Attributes:
- Force Sense Immunity
- Heal (3)
- CTF: 30s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Spy Disguise (3) [Weapon Mode In Melee]
- 3 Poison Darts ^3[CS1 Melee]
- 6 Tracking Darts ^3[CS2 Melee]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Quick Throw (2) ^3[CS3]

^2Strengths^7: Fast, Elusive, and potentially deadly.
^1Weaknesses^7: Poor Protection."